mill, ride the ropes, and be the first to climb as high as possible.\ud83d\udd14\n\n{880297601360090}\n\n**Replay as much as you want:** the map is always refreshing!\n\n# Choose your climbing tool \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\n\nYou've got the choice:\n- Pick axes \u26cf\ufe0f\n- Swords \u2694\ufe0f\n- Axes \ud83e\ude93\n\nFor now, they're all the same, but soon, they'll have special abilities.\n\n# Throw your weapon \ud83c\udfaf\n\nAim the targets, throw your weapon and gather gems!\ud83d\udc8e\n\n**WE'RE STILL A EARLY ACCESS GAME AND IT'S OUR FIRST GAME**\n\nBuy the game to support us! \ud83d\ude4f  ", "short_description": "Climb climb climb! Get your pick axes and use them to climb as fast as possible on top of the mountain. How fast can you go?"}]}, "developer_name": "AtLab 5", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pPrfZ5laXFvFp7GRb2hVCki3BTI7vtvFEWvZWvnpeUM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AtLab 5", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://albyon.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25207885882212355"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "910776298024802"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2469980230123531"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1478459110521641"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id":